Perl extensions for rxvt-unicode:

	keyboard-select: select and copy text with vi-like keyboard
	  shortcuts, including forward/backward search.

	resize-font: change the font size at runtime with keyboard
	  shortcuts, keeping bold/italic variants in sync.

Enable them with URxvt.perl-ext-common in ~/.Xresources, see the
comments at the top of each extension for the available keysyms and
resources.
